 "instructions": "Translate every \"en\" string into Simplified Chinese (zh-Hans), game-guide register. Follow glossary.json strictly. Keep ⟦0⟧-style placeholders, numbers, units and wiki markup exactly. Return only {\"items\":[{\"k\":\"...\",\"zh\":\"...\"}]} with the same k values.",
 "units": [
  {
   "k": "1gwhk89",
   "en": "Starting as Czechoslovakia in Gathering Storm, immediately create a spy agency and do the \"Evaluate the Political Climate\" focus, then Empower the National Fascist League. Immediately recruit the fascists demagogue to your government and discredit the government and prepare for civil war in the decisions tab. Before you start the civil war, go down the Strategic Decisions path in the focus tree and reform the Czech Entente. As soon as the \"An Entente of Our Own\" focus is done (It should be September 2nd, 1936), immediately start the civil war, start going down the Fortification Focus branch of your focus tree for extra manpower, army experience and for a fortified border with ⟦0⟧. Make sure to start justifying war goals on ⟦1⟧ and ⟦2⟧ as soon as the civil war starts. When the Civil War ends, immediately put a front line on the Austrian border, and when the war goal is finished (October 17th, 1936), create an alliance with between ⟦3⟧ before declaring war with Austria. Italy will attempt to invite you to their war with Ethiopia, do not join that war under any circumstances. After the Czechoslovakian-Austrian War, annex all of Austria and station your troops on the border with Yugoslavia, make sure to station troops on the Yugoslav border for Italy too so they will accept an invitation into the Czechoslovakian-Yugoslav War (February 14th, 1937). After the war, take Dalmatia, Croatia, Slovenia, Ljubljana, Backa, West Banat, Herzegovina and Bosnia, if you can puppet any other Yugoslav territory, do so, make sure ⟦4⟧ is it's own puppet so the Italians can't take it through ⟦5⟧ later in the game. Try to end the war before completing the \"Final Fortifications\" focus so you could immediately start the \"Joint Security Council\" focus in the Strategic Decisions branch of your focus, which you should be able to do by bypassing the \"Invite Yugoslavia\" focus when you puppet Yugoslavia. After finishing the \"Joint Security Council\" focus, you should be able to do the \"Czech Fascism\" focus from the Evaluate the Political Climate branch of your focus tree. Do the \"Czech Fascism\" focus now, as it will help distract the Germans later. After the \"Czech Fascism\" focus, do the \"Eliminate the Hungarian Threat\" focus in the Strategic Decision branch of your focus tree, and immediately declare war on ⟦6⟧ when it's completed. While you're at war with Hungary, start the \"Invite Romania\" focus, and when the Czechoslovakian-Hungarian War ends, annex all of Hungary. When the \"Invite Romania\" focus is complete, continue with the \"Dissolve Bulgaria\" focus and immediately declare war on ⟦7⟧, make sure to invite ⟦8⟧ and Italy to participate in the Czechoslovakian-Bulgarian War. When Romania and Italy join the war, the Romanians should also join the Italian-Ethiopian War, when Romania does this, kick them from the faction and start justifying a war goal against them. The Allies will not come to Romania's aide or guarantee them because they're at war with Ethiopia, a member of the Allies. During or after the Czechoslovakian-Bulgarian War, use your spy agency to apply diplomatic pressure on Germany. When Germany starts justifying a war goal against you, start a nonaggression pact with them, once the Germans ask for the Sudetenland, do not give it to them. After the Czechoslovakian-Bulgarian War, try to puppet as much of Bulgaria as you can. Do the \"Aggressive Wars\" focus in the Evaluate the Political Climate branch of your focus tree. If Germany didn't do the \"Fate of Czechoslovakia\" focus in their branch before you did \"The Polish Question\", the Allies shouldn't have guaranteed ⟦9⟧. If Poland has not been guaranteed yet, do \"The Polish Question\" focus in your focus tree and declare war with Poland, Germany should join the war. After the Czechoslovakian-Polish War, try to take Krakow, Stanisławów, Lwów and Kielce, and try to puppet anything else you can get, but the German will get a majority of Poland, so don't expect too much of Poland, the war with Poland is optional for reforming Austria-Hungary. After the war with Poland, immediately put your army on the border with Romania and declare war, make sure to bring in your Bulgarian and Yugoslav puppets, along with Italy. After the Czechoslovakian-Romanian war, annex Banat, Crisana, Northern Transylvania, Transylvania and Bucovina. Make a puppet of Romania, and make two more puppets with the state of Bessarabia as ⟦10⟧ and the state of Southern Bessarabia as ⟦11⟧. After this, go to you decisions tab and click \"Reform Austria-Hungary\", and you should have finished forming ⟦12⟧.",
   "frags": 13
